  "interpretation": "All experiments use 4P4M8C and public sequential ballots. Deterministic mafia vote ties use shared score, public speech order and seat. Every table coordinate-pass has distinct fit and validation seeds, and final matrix seeds are untouched. Civilian probes are selected and reported by unconditional outcomes across every hit opening; activation and alignment only decompose coverage. Results are finite-policy strategy evaluation, not full-game GTO or CFR convergence."
